  "question": {
    "text": "During an adiabatic process, the pressure of an ideal gas is found to be proportional to the cube of its absolute temperature. The ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub></mfrac></math> for the gas is&nbsp;",
